ts=2026-08-26T14:28:20.815Z type=decision scope=user content="decisions made and etc." tags=auto
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:34.393Z type=decision scope=project content="ClipIN is an open self-serve marketplace for performance clipping. No clipper vetting gate. Anyone can sign up, browse campaigns, submit clips. Verification and fraud controls are the quality moat." tags=marketplace,archetype,open
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:35.457Z type=decision scope=project content="Platform fee: 10% flat on campaign deposits. Charged at deposit time. One constant, swappable later." tags=fee,business
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:37.481Z type=decision scope=project content="Verification boundary: services/verifier is owned externally. Writes metric_snapshots to shared table. Main backend reads snapshots and computes all financial logic (growth deltas, engagement ratios, eligible views, earnings). No Redis stream from main backend." tags=verification,architecture,boundary
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:39.009Z type=decision scope=project content="Payouts: Razorpay stubbed behind PayoutProvider interface until account is available. Webhook endpoint built, signature-checked, disabled until keys exist. UPI ₹500 threshold, weekly batch cadence." tags=payouts,razorpay,stub
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:42.508Z type=decision scope=project content="UI approach: shadcn-vue installed just-in-time per milestone. Shared primitives built as each page needs them. Playwright browser testing on every new screen (desktop + mobile, loading/empty/error states). Design tokens in tailwind.config.js + main.css." tags=ui,design,shadcn,playwright
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:43.060Z type=decision scope=project content="Deployment excluded from current scope. Planned separately when production VPS/Cloudflare infrastructure exists." tags=deployment,scope
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:44.534Z type=decision scope=project content="Campaign mechanics (research-backed): Escrow-funded pools (no unfunded campaigns), rate per 1k views (CPM), remaining budget publicly visible, auto-approve-after-48h default, per-clip/per-clipper caps, min view floor, unspent refunded on end." tags=campaigns,mechanics,research
ts=2026-08-26T14:28:48.123Z type=decision scope=project content="Execution order: M0 Foundation → M1 Users/Roles → M2 Campaigns → M3 Creation → M4 Submissions → M5 Verification Contract → M6 Ledger → M7 Payouts → M8 Admin/Fraud → M9 Polish. Sequential, tests-first, TDD, Playwright QA." tags=execution,milestones,plan
